        "content": "Series are `akula_gpu_*` (not nvidia_* / DCGM). Host label is akula-prime or gpu5080 on the exporter; taxonomy host=prime also matches via akula-$host. 3090 LocalAI must stay loaded. Comfy is masked \u2014 `akula_backend_up{backend=\"comfy\"}` is shown only as the live 0, not an SLO to unmask. Catalog path (guest nvidia-smi lists GTX 1080 Ti; no guest Prom series yet): group=akula-rag host=gpu5080 path=lab.gpu5080.index.1080ti. Do not invent 1080 Ti panels.",
